@startuml Behavioral_Sequence_Diagram
actor Student
participant "UI Portal" as UI
participant "LibraryService" as Svc
database "Catalog DB" as DB

Student -> UI: Request Book Issue(ISBN)
UI -> Svc: issueBook(ISBN, memberId)
Svc -> DB: checkAvailability(ISBN)
DB --> Svc: available = true
Svc -> DB: createLoanRecord()
DB --> Svc: loanId
Svc --> UI: Issue Confirmed
UI --> Student: Display Due Date Receipt
@enduml
